OL,3,ATeenage girl admits murder in row over
OL,4,Aboy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has admitted murdering a
OL,7,F16-year-old girl who she stabbed to
OL,8,Fdeath in a pre-planned fight over a
OL,9,Fboy.
OL,11,FChloe Watson Dransfield, 16, was taken
OL,12,Fby her boyfriend Blake Dowling, 18, to
OL,13,Fthe home of Kayla Smith, 18, who
OL,14,Ffatally stabbed her in the early hours
OL,15,Fof 28 March.
OL,17,FSmith had pleaded guilty to
OL,18,Fmanslaughter but denied murder. She
OL,19,Fthen changed her plea to guilty on the
OL,20,Fsecond day of her trial at Leeds Crown
OL,21,FCourt.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
